From fbf17531a4be72a31f1637dba38091c74f49cde0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bigmangeekf <bigmangeekf@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 02:58:13 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Relay voice chat through the server

IW7 sends voice peer to peer through Demonware address handles, which
iw7-mod does not have, so clients never found anyone to send voice to.
Clients now keep the game's own capture and listener rules but send the
frames to the server, which forwards them to those listeners.
---
